<comment>MacLogger DX Represents the file within which a looger program keeps track of the QSOs.  This model will show the system extracting the relevant information from the logger file into  &quot;HARC SNN QSO Information&quot;.  

This could just as easily be done by creating a view into the logger file that accomplishes the same task; extracting only the data needed to run the Sunday Night Net System.  A view will be created from &quot;HARC SNN QSO Information&quot; for this iteration</comment>
</OView>
